{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061033/block/singleImage/3252650/df/01M63PGTGG2P5CH70SXWVDZXTF.png?updatedAt=1793273402\"/><figcaption>東鵬飲料首三季淨利潤升至41億人幣，第三季純利跌7.8%（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>東鵬飲料 (9980) 公布 2026 年 9 月底止首三季業績，收入 185.96 億元人民幣 ( 下同 ) ，按年升 10.4% 。淨利潤 41.45 億元，按年升 10.21% ；每股盈利 5.7505 元。單計第三季，收入按年升 0.75% 至 61.53 億元，純利跌 7.8% 至 12.78 億元，每股盈利 1.7556 元。 若按照業務產品類別分類，能量飲料收入為 127.80 億元，佔比 68.80% ；電解質飲料收入為 30.32 億元，佔比 16.32% ；茶飲料收入為 16.38 億元，佔比 8.82% ；其他飲料收入為 11.24 億元，佔比 6.06% 。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:41:39.381240+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T11:30:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.596224+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:21.364572+00:00","content_hash":"7a2146f3a1c2c942032b65dc1d689ea576bd36ca7621791224e4ea9136c38b08","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T12:41:39.381240+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}